# Initial Setup's Compass/Motor Calib page, ported from GCSViews/ConfigurationView/
# ConfigCompassMot.cs (PLAN.md §13.6 row 70).
#
# THIS PAGE RUNS THE MOTORS. Start sends ArduPilot's compassmot (MAV_CMD_PREFLIGHT_CALIBRATION,
# param6 1), which spins the motors to the pilot's throttle while it measures their interference
# on the compass. This script is for SITL only - never with propellers fitted to anything the link
# reaches, never on a real vehicle.
#
# The claim: Activate sets the button to "Start" and subscribes to COMPASSMOT_STATUS
# (ConfigCompassMot.cs:25-30); the button reads "Finish", runs DoCompassMot - the vehicle's
# messages cleared, the curves emptied, the command sent - and starts the 100 ms timer that
# writes the vehicle's messages into the box (:50-85, 164-173); a second press is SendAck, the
# COMMAND_ACK that ends the calibration, and "Start" again; Deactivate sends the ack too and ends
# the subscription (:32-48). Each COMPASSMOT_STATUS is read out and charted (:87-119).
#
# SITL's copter, disarmed on the ground, refuses to start compassmot ("Compass Motor
# Calibration... not armed" or its throttle message) and sends no status, so the run proves the
# command, the ack and the page's states, not the chart's points.
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 started from tools/sitl/params/copter.parm. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/config-compassmot.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen params
window 1600x1200
settle 6
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

click param-download
settle 15
expect params.held > 1000

click tab-setup
expect config.compassmot.active false
click setup-page-ConfigOptional
click setup-page-ConfigCompassMot
settle 1
expect setup.page ConfigCompassMot
expect config.compassmot.active true
expect config.compassmot.button Start
expect config.compassmot.running false
expect config.compassmot.subscribed true
expect config.compassmot.timer false
expect config.compassmot.starts 0
expect config.compassmot.acks 0
expect config.compassmot.points 0

# Start: the command sent, the timer running, the box filling with the vehicle's messages.
click compassmot-button
settle 3
expect config.compassmot.button Finish
expect config.compassmot.running true
expect config.compassmot.timer true
expect config.compassmot.starts 1

# Finish: the ack, and "Start" again.
click compassmot-button
settle 2
expect config.compassmot.button Start
expect config.compassmot.running false
expect config.compassmot.acks 1

# Choosing another page is Deactivate: the ack once more, the subscription ended.
click setup-page-ConfigOptional
settle 1
expect config.compassmot.active false
expect config.compassmot.acks 2
expect config.compassmot.subscribed false
